            "text": "theorem packed_state_iff {B q e : ℕ} (hB : 1 < B) (σ η : ℕ → ℕ) (hσ : ∀ t ≤ q, σ t ≤ 1)\n    (hη : ∀ t ≤ q, η t ≤ 1) (he : e ≤ 1) :\n    (∑ t ∈ range (q + 1), σ t * B ^ t) = e + B * (∑ t ∈ range (q + 1), η t * B ^ t) ↔\n      σ 0 = e ∧ (∀ t < q, σ (t + 1) = η t) ∧ η q = 0 := by",
